Z||000000||RossT||12-11-2001||12:22 AM||||I have always wanted an autoxray scanner but could not justify the cost.  Even the ones on e-bay are going for almost new prices.<P>I came across <A HREF="http://www.autocheckup.com" TARGET=_blank>www.autocheckup.com</A>  .  They have refurbished older models XP240 for $89.<BR>The older model does everything the new one does but you can not attach it to a PC.  <P>Mine came in the mail today and looks brand new!!!  Best of all it comes with a one year<BR>warranty.<P>Just thought you guys would like to know.  I thank "The Ogre" for his info on the autoxray scanners!!||||reg||1
